Package: x-messenger
Version: 1.5.2
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 18) | node (>= 18), openssl, ca-certificates, xdg-utils, python3-gi, gir1.2-webkit-6.0 | gir1.2-webkit2-4.1, libwebkitgtk-6.0-4 | libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0
Recommends: certutil | libnss3-tools
Maintainer: jackh0006 <jackh109867@gmail.com>
Description: X Messenger offline encrypted QR courier
 X Messenger encrypts local messages for QR, text, and file transfer.
 It has no service, account, or Internet permission in its Android counterpart.
 Loopback-only HTTPS GUI (127.0.0.1), CAMERA-only Android, portable tarball available.
